      "title": "Tags on notes, and the index Add keeps",
      "kind": "logical",
      "hunks": [
        "@note.go",
        "@store.go"
      ],
      "summary": {
        "text": "`Note` gains `Tags`. `Store.Add` cleans a note's tags before saving it and records the note's position under each of its tags, in a map the store creates on first use.",
